<title>AUSTRALIA: Anaconda requests share trading suspended.</title>
<headline>Anaconda requests share trading suspended.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anaconda Nickel NL said on Wednesday that it had requested a share trading suspension pending the release of an announcement.</p>
<p>The company is developing the A$900 million Murrin Murrin nickel and cobalt project in Western Australia.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
